OL,3,GNEWSANew laws planned to tackle rogue
OL,4,Afuneral firms
OL,5,
OL,6,FA minister has said the government is
OL,7,Fworking on new laws to "drive rogue
OL,8,Foperators out of the funeral industry".
OL,10,FSecretary of State for Health and
OL,11,FSocial Care Yvette Cooper gave a
OL,12,Fwritten update to Parliament on
OL,13,Fproposed legislation to regulate
OL,14,Fundertakers.
OL,16,FIt comes after a Hull funeral home
OL,17,Fdirector was jailed last month for
OL,18,Ffailing to bury or cremate people and
OL,19,Fgiving bereaved relatives the ashes of
OL,20,Fstrangers.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,384,380,200,160,0,100
