OL,3,GNEWSANew laws planned to tackle rogue
OL,4,Afuneral firms
OL,5,
OL,6,FRobert Bush was sent to prison for 20
OL,7,Fyears after he admitted 67 offences,
OL,8,Fincluding denying 30 people a decent
OL,9,Fand proper burial, theft from
OL,10,Fcharities, and fraudulent trading over
OL,11,Fa period of almost 12 years.
